"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9c54f73\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"0\":\"#\",\"1\":\"6\",\"2\":\"1\",\"3\":\"C\",\"4\":\"E\",\"5\":\"7\",\"6\":\"0\",\"carousel_name\":\"Image Carousel\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":372,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert.png\"},{\"id\":377,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert3.png\"},{\"id\":378,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert2.png\"}],\"thumbnail_size\":\"large\",\"slides_to_show\":\"1\",\"navigation\":\"arrows\",\"link_to\":\"file\",\"caption_type\":\"caption\",\"autoplay_speed\":1500,\"arrows_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]},\"arrows_color\":\"#010202\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"7\",\"right\":\"7\",\"bottom\":\"7\",\"left\":\"7\",\"isLinked\":true},\"caption_text_color\":\"#0A1628\",\"caption_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"caption_typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"caption_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"caption_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"caption_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-carousel\"},{\"id\":\"d414975\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<script>\\r\\nwindow.addEventListener(\\\"load\\\", function () {\\r\\n\\r\\n    const descBox = document.getElementById(\\\"cert-desc\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n    const titles = [\\r\\n        \\\"Google UX Design\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Web Development Certificate\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"UI\\/UX Masterclass\\\"\\r\\n    ];\\r\\n\\r\\n    const descriptions = [\\r\\n        \\\"Learned wireframing, prototyping, and UI\\/UX fundamentals using Figma.\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Focused on HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WordPress development.\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Advanced UI design systems and accessibility principles.\\\"\\r\\n    ];\\r\\n\\r\\n    function init() {\\r\\n\\r\\n        const slides = document.querySelectorAll(\\\"#cert-carousel .swiper-slide\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n        if (!slides.length) return false;\\r\\n\\r\\n        slides.forEach((slide, index) => {\\r\\n\\r\\n            const img = slide.querySelector(\\\"img\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n            if (!img) return;\\r\\n\\r\\n            img.style.cursor = \\\"pointer\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n            img.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", function () {\\r\\n\\r\\n                descBox.innerHTML = `\\r\\n                    <h2>${titles[index] || \\\"Certificate\\\"}<\\/h2>\\r\\n                    <p>${descriptions[index] || \\\"\\\"}<\\/p>\\r\\n                `;\\r\\n            });\\r\\n\\r\\n        });\\r\\n\\r\\n        return true;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    let tries = 0;\\r\\n\\r\\n    const check = setInterval(() => {\\r\\n\\r\\n        tries++;\\r\\n\\r\\n        if (init() || tries > 10) {\\r\\n            clearInterval(check);\\r\\n        }\\r\\n\\r\\n    }, 500);\\r\\n\\r\\n});\\r\\n<\\/script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
