"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9c54f73\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"0\":\"#\",\"1\":\"6\",\"2\":\"1\",\"3\":\"C\",\"4\":\"E\",\"5\":\"7\",\"6\":\"0\",\"carousel_name\":\"Image Carousel\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":372,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert.png\"},{\"id\":377,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert3.png\"},{\"id\":378,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/portfoliomaiz.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/cert2.png\"}],\"thumbnail_size\":\"large\",\"slides_to_show\":\"1\",\"navigation\":\"arrows\",\"link_to\":\"file\",\"caption_type\":\"caption\",\"arrows_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]},\"arrows_color\":\"#010202\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"7\",\"right\":\"7\",\"bottom\":\"7\",\"left\":\"7\",\"isLinked\":true},\"caption_text_color\":\"#0A1628\",\"caption_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"caption_typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"caption_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"caption_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"caption_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"caption_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-carousel\"},{\"id\":\"d414975\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<script>\\r\\nwindow.addEventListener(\\\"load\\\", function () {\\r\\n\\r\\n    const descBox = document.getElementById(\\\"cert-desc\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n    const titles = [\\r\\n        \\\"Google UX Design\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Web Development Certificate\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"UI\\/UX Masterclass\\\"\\r\\n    ];\\r\\n\\r\\n    const descriptions = [\\r\\n        \\\"Learned wireframing, prototyping, and UI\\/UX fundamentals using Figma.\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Focused on HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WordPress development.\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"Advanced UI design systems and accessibility principles.\\\"\\r\\n    ];\\r\\n\\r\\n    function updateActiveSlide() {\\r\\n\\r\\n        const slides = document.querySelectorAll(\\\"#cert-carousel .swiper-slide\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n        slides.forEach((slide) => {\\r\\n\\r\\n            if (slide.classList.contains(\\\"swiper-slide-active\\\")) {\\r\\n\\r\\n                \\/\\/ Get real index (not DOM index)\\r\\n                const allSlides = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\"#cert-carousel .swiper-slide\\\"));\\r\\n                const realIndex = allSlides.indexOf(slide) % titles.length;\\r\\n\\r\\n                descBox.innerHTML = `\\r\\n                    <h2>${titles[realIndex]}<\\/h2>\\r\\n                    <p>${descriptions[realIndex]}<\\/p>\\r\\n                `;\\r\\n            }\\r\\n        });\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    \\/\\/ Run initially\\r\\n    setTimeout(updateActiveSlide, 1000);\\r\\n\\r\\n    \\/\\/ Listen for slide changes\\r\\n    const carousel = document.querySelector(\\\"#cert-carousel\\\");\\r\\n\\r\\n    if (carousel) {\\r\\n        const observer = new MutationObserver(updateActiveSlide);\\r\\n        observer.observe(carousel, {\\r\\n            subtree: true,\\r\\n            attributes: true,\\r\\n            attributeFilter: [\\\"class\\\"]\\r\\n        });\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n});\\r\\n<\\/script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
