echnologies such as PHP, Java, HTML, CSS, React.js, and Node.js. I also design user interfaces using Figma and create visual content using Canva, along with handling documentation through Microsoft Word.</strong><br /><br /><strong>As an aspiring IT professional, I am passionate about building functional and visually engaging digital solutions. I am continuously learning, improving, and growing to keep up with new technologies and industry trends.</strong><br /><br /><strong>I’m driven to turn ideas into reality and excited to contribute my skills and creativity to future opportunities.</strong></p>													<img width=\"492\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-492x1024.jpg 492w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09-144x300.jpg 144w, http://portfoliomaiz.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4b877422-90be-4a42-842f-8a2e87bbdb09.jpg 715w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 492px) 100vw, 492px\" />																<h2>About Me</h2>',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'55-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-05-04 08:30:20',	'2026-05-04 08:30:20',	'',	55,	'http://portfoliomaiz.local/?p=148',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
